#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Operators and their structure {#operators-and-their-structure}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A bosonic operator is a sum of ordered products of creation and annihilation"
" operators, and a mode can appear more than once in a term. Bosonic "
"operators can also tag their terms with group indices, which later stages "
"use to split a time evolution along physically meaningful pieces. Mappers "
"turn an operator into a qubit operator under a truncation and an encoding. "
"Start here if you are building a Hamiltonian.\n"
msgstr ""

